            "In your Cloudflare dashboard, open R2 Object Storage and create a bucket (for example \u201cmy-pbs-library\u201d). Keep it private: do not connect a public domain.": [
                "Ve sv\u00e9 n\u00e1st\u011bnce Cloudflare otev\u0159ete R2 Object Storage a vytvo\u0159te bucket (nap\u0159\u00edklad \u201emy-pbs-library\u201c). Ponechte jej soukrom\u00fd: nep\u0159ipojujte ve\u0159ejnou dom\u00e9nu."
            ],
            "Open \u201cManage API tokens\u201d in R2 and create an API token with \u201cObject Read & Write\u201d permission, limited to that one bucket.": [
                "Otev\u0159ete \u201eSpravovat tokeny API\u201c v R2 a vytvo\u0159te token API s opr\u00e1vn\u011bn\u00edm \u201e\u010cten\u00ed a z\u00e1pis objekt\u016f\u201c, omezen\u00fd pouze na tento jeden kbel\u00edk."
            ],
            "Copy the Access Key ID and the Secret Access Key it shows (the secret is shown only once).": [
                "Zkop\u00edrujte zobrazen\u00e9 ID p\u0159\u00edstupov\u00e9ho kl\u00ed\u010de a tajn\u00fd p\u0159\u00edstupov\u00fd kl\u00ed\u010d (tajn\u00fd kl\u00ed\u010d se zobrazuje pouze jednou)."
            ],
            "Copy the S3 endpoint for your account. It looks like https:\/\/<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Region is \u201cauto\u201d.": [
                "Zkop\u00edrujte koncov\u00fd bod S3 pro sv\u016fj \u00fa\u010det. Vypad\u00e1 jako https:\/\/<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Oblast je \u201eauto\u201c."
            ],
            "Paste the values below, save, then press \u201cTest connection\u201d. Switch the library to your storage only when the test passes.": [
                "Vlo\u017ete n\u00ed\u017ee uveden\u00e9 hodnoty, ulo\u017ete je a pot\u00e9 stiskn\u011bte \u201eOtestovat p\u0159ipojen\u00ed\u201c. Knihovnu p\u0159epn\u011bte na sv\u00e9 \u00falo\u017ei\u0161t\u011b a\u017e po \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u00e9m prob\u011bhnut\u00ed testu."
            ],
            "Create a private bucket with your provider (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO or any S3-compatible service).": [
                "Vytvo\u0159te si soukrom\u00fd bucket u sv\u00e9ho poskytovatele (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO nebo jak\u00e9koli slu\u017eby kompatibiln\u00ed s S3)."
            ],
            "Create an access key that can read, write and delete objects in that bucket only.": [
                "Vytvo\u0159te p\u0159\u00edstupov\u00fd kl\u00ed\u010d, kter\u00fd m\u016f\u017ee \u010d\u00edst, zapisovat a mazat objekty pouze v tomto bucketu."
            ],
            "Find the S3 endpoint (for Amazon S3: %s) and the bucket\u2019s region.": [
                "Najd\u011bte koncov\u00fd bod S3 (pro Amazon S3: %s) a oblast bucketu."
            ],
            "Amazon S3 uses virtual-hosted addresses: switch off \u201cPath-style addresses\u201d. Most other services use path-style.": [
                "Amazon S3 pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 virtu\u00e1ln\u011b hostovan\u00e9 adresy: vypn\u011bte \u201ePath-style addresses\u201c. V\u011bt\u0161ina ostatn\u00edch slu\u017eeb pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 styl cesty."
            ],
            "Paste the values below, save, then press \u201cTest connection\u201d.": [
                "Vlo\u017ete hodnoty n\u00ed\u017ee, ulo\u017ete je a pot\u00e9 stiskn\u011bte \u201eOtestovat p\u0159ipojen\u00ed\u201c."
            ],
            "Storage settings saved.": [
