            ],
            "Your cloud library is kept in Zinn Digital\u00ae storage with the space your plan includes. You can keep it in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket instead: then no Zinn Digital\u00ae quota applies, and every site you connect to the same bucket shares the library. Team libraries always use Zinn Digital\u00ae storage.": [
                "Va\u0161e cloudov\u00e1 knihovna je ulo\u017eena v \u00falo\u017ei\u0161ti Zinn Digital\u00ae s prostorem, kter\u00fd v\u00e1\u0161 tarif zahrnuje. M\u00edsto toho ji m\u016f\u017eete uchov\u00e1vat ve sv\u00e9m vlastn\u00edm bucketu Cloudflare R2 nebo S3 kompatibiln\u00edm: pak se neuplat\u0148uje \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e1 kv\u00f3ta Zinn Digital\u00ae a ka\u017ed\u00fd web, kter\u00fd p\u0159ipoj\u00edte ke stejn\u00e9mu bucketu, tuto knihovnu sd\u00edl\u00ed. T\u00fdmov\u00e9 knihovny v\u017edy vyu\u017e\u00edvaj\u00ed \u00falo\u017ei\u0161t\u011b Zinn Digital\u00ae."
